### Core Theoretical Synthesis

The provided analytical schema articulates a unified model of **Institutional Drift and Epistemic Decay**. By synthesizing the structural mechanics of _Autonomically Perpetuated Clerical Deprivation_ with the cognitive and structural dynamics of _Intellectual Authoritarianism_ and _Institutional Dogmatism_, we can chart how modern institutions decay from functional governance into self-perpetuating, closed epistemic feedback loops.

